+## Routes
+
+All routes are listed under Routes in `README.md`.
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with the header `ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Quantities are positive whole portions; previously imported tickets are skipped. It returns `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }` with the number of distinct tickets and total portions imported. Errors identify the CSV row.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` for the inclusive UTC date range. Difference is actual minus theoretical, in the item’s unit.
+
